MODULE: ThrottledNeverRefusesShedOnThrottled
TARGET: ThrottledNeverRefuses
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: snapshot admission sheds a throttled tree
PERTURBS: ShedOpen

--- FIND
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.shed = Shed(LogicalValue(1)),
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: shed Throttled as well as Saturated.
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.shed = LogicalValue(1) >= 1,
--- END
